@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:deployment] machine-inputs-not-invented
Reference host adapters MUST preserve the actual reviewed hardware, network and
persistent identity inputs. Generic examples MUST remain identified as examples;
their disk paths and DNS names MUST NOT be presented as an existing host's values.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:security] images-generate-private-host-identity
Reusable installation and QEMU images MUST contain no private host keys or
application credentials. New machines MUST generate their own persistent SSH
Ed25519 key. Test instrumentation MUST remain confined to test variants.
